---
import '../../styles/lab/v4/visual-spike.css';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#0b0e11" />
    <meta name="description" content="Black Architecture: a static cinematic study of complexity, decision and coherence." />
    <title>Black Architecture · Decision Theatre V4</title>
    <link rel="icon" href="/assets/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml" />
  </head>
  <body class="v4-page">
    <a class="v4-skip" href="#study">Skip to the visual study</a>
    <header class="v4-header">
      <a class="v4-brand" href="/lab/decision-theatre-v2"><span>ak<span>·</span></span> Arkadiusz Kamrowski</a>
      <p>Decision Theatre <span>/</span> Visual study 04</p>
      <a href="/lab/decision-theatre-v2">V3 baseline <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 10 10 2M2 2h8v8" stroke="currentColor"/></svg></a>
    </header>
    <main id="study" tabindex="-1" data-v4>
      <section class="v4-plate" aria-labelledby="study-title">
        <div class="v4-fallback" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 1200 800" fill="none"><defs><linearGradient id="metal"><stop stop-color="#13191e"/><stop offset=".48" stop-color="#414d55"/><stop offset=".51" stop-color="#10161c"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#52616c"/></linearGradient></defs><g stroke="#76848c" stroke-width="1.2" fill="url(#metal)"><path d="M570 170 870 95 870 620 570 700ZM625 215 625 620 817 567 817 167Z" fill-rule="evenodd"/><path d="M760 185 1000 260 1000 680 760 606ZM803 247 803 562 958 609 958 294Z" fill-rule="evenodd"/></g></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="v4-canvas" data-v4-canvas aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="v4-plate-top"><span>BLACK ARCHITECTURE / I–III</span><span>Static look development</span></div>
        <div class="v4-title"><p class="v4-eyebrow" data-frame-label>01 / Complexity</p><h1 id="study-title">Black<br /><em>architecture.</em></h1><p class="v4-thesis">Complexity into clarity.<br />A study in structure, light and consequence.</p></div>
        <p class="v4-plate-caption"><span data-caption>Related volumes. Unresolved relationships.</span><span>AK—DT / 04</span></p>
      </section>
      <section class="v4-desk" aria-label="Static look-development controls">
        <div class="v4-frame-controls" role="group" aria-label="Keyframe">
          <button data-frame="complexity" aria-pressed="true"><span>01</span> Complexity</button>
          <button data-frame="transformation" aria-pressed="false"><span>02</span> Transformation</button>
          <button data-frame="coherence" aria-pressed="false"><span>03</span> Coherence</button>
        </div>
        <div class="v4-study-controls">
          <label>Composition<select data-candidate><option value="incision">Incision / monumental</option><option value="compression">Compression / macro</option></select></label>
          <label>Light study<select data-quality><option value="studio">Studio reflections</option><option value="direct">Direct light only</option></select></label>
          <label>Camera<select data-camera><option value="wide">Composed view</option><option value="detail">Material detail</option></select></label>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="v4-notes" aria-label="Study brief">
        <p class="v4-eyebrow">The decision system</p><h2>A structure earns<br />its coherence.</h2>
        <div><p>Three static compositions of the same physical system. Large volumes, a deliberate opening, a shared material language. This study tests whether light and spatial relationships can carry the argument before motion is introduced.</p><p class="v4-status" role="status" data-status>Static structural illustration. The interactive Three.js study loads when available.</p><p class="v4-disclosure">Visual direction awaits owner review. No animation, merge or deployment.</p></div>
      </section>
    </main>
    <footer class="v4-footer"><span>Arkadiusz Kamrowski / Decision Theatre</span><span>Independent judgment. Deliberate structure.</span><a href="/contact">Discuss the decision <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 10 10 2M2 2h8v8" stroke="currentColor"/></svg></a></footer>
    <script>import '../../scripts/lab/v4/visual-spike';</script>
  </body>
</html>
